                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DUvjy",
                  "name": "Hi Alex,\n\nI want to tell you about my mother. She has always support me when I try something new. Last month, I felt nervous about learning the guitar, but she told me to practise a little every day. Her advice helped me stay patient. I have learned three songs since then, and I feel more confident now. I admire her because she listens carefully and never makes me afraid of mistakes. Who has helped you learn something new?\n\nBest wishes,\nJavohir",
                  "fill": "$play-ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Hi Alex,\n\nI want to tell you about my mother. She has always support me when I try something new. Last month, I felt nervous about learning the guitar, but she told me to practise a little every day. Her advice helped me stay patient. I have learned three songs since then, and I feel more confident now. I admire her because she listens carefully and never makes me afraid of mistakes. Who has helped you learn something new?\n\nBest wishes,\nJavohir",
